%% 图 3-15 模块三：信用与候补模块 详细设计类图
classDiagram
    direction LR

    class CreditLog {
        +int64 ID
        +int64 UserID
        +int Delta
        +string Reason
        +int64 ReservationID
        +Time CreatedAt
    }

    class CreditOverview {
        +int Score
        +Time BannedUntil
        +CreditLog[] Logs
    }

    class WaitlistEntry {
        +int64 ID
        +int64 UserID
        +int64 RoomID
        +Date ResDate
        +Time StartTime
        +Time EndTime
        +string Status
    }

    class WaitlistView {
        +WaitlistEntry Entry
        +string RoomName
        +int Position
    }

    class Notification {
        +int64 ID
        +int64 UserID
        +string Type
        +string Title
        +string Content
        +bool IsRead
    }

    class CreditService {
        +OnViolation(res)
        +OnComplete(res)
        +ApplyLateCancel(res)
        +GetOverview(uid) CreditOverview
        -ApplyDelta(uid, delta, reason)
    }

    class WaitlistService {
        +Join(uid, req) View
        +Cancel(uid, id)
        +ListMine(uid) View[]
        +PromoteTick() int
        +ExpireTick() int
    }

    class NotificationService {
        +Push(uid, type, title, content)
        +List(uid) Notification[]
        +UnreadCount(uid) int
        +MarkRead(uid, id)
        +MarkAllRead(uid)
    }

    class LifecycleHooks {
        <<interface>>
        +OnViolation(res)
        +OnComplete(res)
    }

    CreditService ..|> LifecycleHooks : 违约扣分/履约加分
    NotificationService ..|> LifecycleHooks : 事件推送
    CreditService ..> CreditLog : 原子写流水
    CreditService ..> CreditOverview : 汇总查询
    WaitlistService ..> WaitlistEntry : 先到先得排队
    WaitlistService ..> WaitlistView : 位次计算
    WaitlistService ..> ReservationService : 递补下单(source=waitlist)
    WaitlistService ..> NotificationService : 递补成功通知
    NotificationService ..> Notification : 分发与已读管理
